@startuml
title Calibration Analyze Flow (LM / FS / GSP)

actor Engineer
participant "LM Shot Inputs\nassets/data/*.json + shot_session_*" as LM
participant "Calibrator\ncalibrate.py analyze" as Cal
participant "Physics Export\nexport_physics_csv.gd" as Export
participant "FS Sources\nfs_SoT.csv + session fs_reference.json" as FS
participant "GSP Source\ngsp_SoT.csv (optional)" as GSP
participant "Comparator\n(compare_csv.py)" as Compare
participant "Carry Exception Layer\ncarry_exception_profile.json (optional)" as CarryX
participant "Reports\nshot_diff_analysis.csv + history/iteration_*.json" as Reports

Engineer -> Cal: Run analyze [--gsp]
Cal -> LM: Load LM shot files
Cal -> Export: Export physics.csv
Export --> Cal: physics.csv
Cal -> FS: Build merged fs.csv
Cal -> GSP: Build gsp.csv (if --gsp)
Cal -> Compare: Compare physics vs fs (+ gsp optional)
Compare -> CarryX: Apply optional carry exceptions
CarryX --> Compare: corrected carry + metadata
Compare --> Cal: shot_diff_analysis.csv
Cal -> Reports: Write critical reports + iteration snapshot
Reports --> Engineer: Review diff_carry_yd and diff_gsp_* fields

@enduml
